            "sid": "NUM 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ragiira Abaisraeli oti: Ku murihika omu nsi ya Kanaani, (niyo nsi ei muriheebwa kuba obuhunguzi, nk'emyatano yaayo oku eri) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.15.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 15:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ekicweka kyanyu eky'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo kiryaruga aha ihamba rya Ziini, kirabe aha rubaju rwa Edomu, kandi omwatano gwanyu ogw'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo guryatandikira aha Nyanja y'Omwonyo okwiha aha muheru gwayo aha bukiizi bw'oburugwa-izooba; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ogwo mwatano gwanyu gukiikame gutoore aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo aharikwinamuka Akarabiimu, gwogyemu guhikye Ziini, gugarukire aha rubaju rwa Kadeshi-barunea aha bukiizi bwayo obwa-buryo; gugumizemu, guhikye Hazari-adaari, gwogyemu guhikye Azimooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima gurugye Azimooni, gukiikame, guhikye aha kagyera ka Misri, gugarukire aha Nyanja Empango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwatano gwayo ogw'aha burengyerwa-izooba guryaba Enyanja Empango n'embaju zaayo; ogwo nigwo guriba omwatano gwanyu aha rubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ogu nigwo guriba omwatano gwanyu aha rubaju r'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho; okwiha aha Nyanja Empango muryataho omwatano guhikye aha rushozi Hoori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okuruga aha rushozi Hoori muteho omwatano guhikye ahu orikutaahira nooza Hamasi, gugarukire Zedadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima omwatano gugumizemu guhikye Zifurooni, gugarukire Hazari-enani; ogwo gube nigwo gwaba omwatano gwanyu ogw'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi muryataho omwatano gwanyu aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba okuruga Hazari-enani okuhika Shefamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gurugye Shefamu, gushuume, guhikye Ribula aha rubaju rwa Aini orw'oburugwa-izooba; gugumizemu gushuume, guhikye aha rubaju rw'enyanja ya Kinereesi oburugwa-izooba; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gugumizemu gushuume guhikye Yorudani, gugarukire aha Nyanja y'Omwonyo; egyo niyo eriba ensi yaanyu, nk'emyatano yaayo egyehinguririize oku eri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
